    "sections": {
        "description": "Plumber Handyman Lite is a versatile and minimalist theme tailored for professionals seeking a clean and sophisticated online presence. Whether you are a plumber, handyman, or contractor in the construction and renovation sectors, this theme is perfect for showcasing your home services and maintenance services, including plumbing services and house repair. It features a retina-ready, user-friendly, and responsive design that ensures an enjoyable experience on all devices. Its modern and luxurious aesthetic highlights your offerings through an engaging banner, a striking Call to Action (CTA) button, and well-organized sections to promote your skills and expertise. Built with optimized and secure code, the theme guarantees quick page loading times and smooth navigation. Being mobile-friendly, it ensures your site looks impressive on both desktops and smartphones. Utilizing the Bootstrap framework, the theme supports animations and shortcodes for a professional and engaging user experience. You’ll find smart personalization options that allow you to customize layouts, colors, images, and typography to reflect your brand effortlessly. The Team section lets you showcase your crew, while the testimonials area displays customer feedback, helping to establish credibility and customer trust. Plumber Handyman Lite is also agency-friendly, making it a great choice for multi-service businesses and service firms. With translation-ready support, you can easily reach audiences in various languages and regions. Overall, this theme combines style and functionality, providing a responsive, customizable, and beautifully designed web solution for any service-based business."
    },
